          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "JtAxf",
              "name": "darticle",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gW8p5",
                  "name": "dpara1",
                  "fill": "#A0A0B8",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Spring Boot 最令人着迷的特性之一，便是它的「零配置」启动体验。开发者只需引入一个 starter 依赖，框架便能自动完成数十乃至数百个 Bean 的装配。这背后的魔法，正是 @EnableAutoConfiguration 注解与 SpringFactoriesLoader 机制的协同运作。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "9jTdj",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 32
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "6HhJ7",
                  "name": "dh2",
                  "fill": "#F0F0F8",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "一、自动配置的入口：@SpringBootApplication",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "ktPi8",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 16
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "POZRy",
                  "name": "dpara2",
                  "fill": "#A0A0B8",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "@SpringBootApplication 是一个组合注解，其中最关键的是 @EnableAutoConfiguration。它通过 @Import(AutoConfigurationImportSelector.class) 将自动配置的选择逻辑注入到 Spring 的 Bean 加载流程中。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "cnYPP",
                  "fill": "#00000000",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 20
                },
