                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SpringFactoriesLoader 会扫描所有 jar 包中 META-INF/spring.factories 文件，读取 EnableAutoConfiguration 对应的配置类列表，并通过条件注解（@ConditionalOnClass、@ConditionalOnMissingBean 等）按需装配。",
